#
# Provides the Color class, the central API surface of the Adelia color library.
# A Color wraps a packed 24-bit hexadecimal value and provides convenient access
# to RGB channel extraction, color space conversions (HSL, HSV, CMYK), CSS and
# ANSI terminal formatting, complementary and web-safe color derivation, and
# perceptual distance computation. Static factory methods allow constructing
# Color instances from any supported color space representation.
#
